# API Test Conventions

- Use Playwright `request` fixture or a dedicated API helper class
- Base URL from `API_BASE_URL` env var: `https://api.practicesoftwaretesting.com`
- Only call endpoints documented in OpenAPI / Swagger — do not guess routes
- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <token>` from `POST /users/login`
- Assert status code **and** response body fields (not status alone)
- Create a **fresh cart** per test; do not reuse cart after invoice creation
- Chain: register → login → cart → products → invoice (per assessment AC)

```javascript
// Assert meaningfully
expect(response.status()).toBe(201);
const body = await response.json();
expect(body.id).toBeTruthy();
```

- Store reusable API methods in `utils/` or `fixtures/` — not inline in every spec
